      "text": {
        "jp": "ばあちゃんは鎮め石だって言ってたな。\r\nだったら何を封印したんだ？",
        "official_en": "I heard Grandma say it was a sealing stone, but that just leaves me with more questions. Like, what’s it supposed to seal?",
        "real_en": null
      },
