      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もしかして幻獣？\r\n封印を解く方法があれば\r\n確かめられるんだけどな。",
        "official_en": "An esper, maybe? Wish I knew how to break the seal...then I could see for myself.",
        "real_en": "An Eidolon, maybe? If I knew how to break the seal, I could find out."
