      "text": {
        "jp": "普通の手段では解けないらしい。\r\nまぁ、封印だから当然か。",
        "official_en": "Though apparently it can’t be broken by any ordinary means. Figures—if any regular schmo could smash it open, it wouldn’t be much of a seal I guess.",
        "real_en": "Apparently, it can't be broken by ordinary means. Well, I guess that's to be expected of a seal."
